  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "解析链",
      "items": [
        "所有 fromXxx 入口最终落到 fromJsonReaderSyncInternal，内部 new LottieComposition 后交给 LottieCompositionMoshiParser.parse",
        "LottieCompositionFactory.taskCache 按 cacheKey 缓存 LottieTask，避免同一动画并发解析"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "渲染链",
      "items": [
